      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How much does a tree bookcase cost at Wrydeco?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Wrydeco's Handcrafted Tree Bookshelves collection has 106 designs priced from $314.00 to $10,249.00. The smallest listed size, 15\"W x 8\"H x 8\"D, starts at $314.00. The final price depends on the design, the size and the wood finish chosen."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Can I order a custom tree bookshelf?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. Several Wrydeco tree bookshelves offer a Custom size option, and Custom is also available as a wood finish. Some designs let you choose a width of 60 or 70 inches with a height and depth of 60\"H x 12\"D, 70\"H x 12\"D or Custom. Branch decoration can be set to None, Flowers or Leafs on some designs. Confirm the price of a custom size before ordering."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Which wood finishes are available for a wood tree bookcase?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Wrydeco lists nine finishes across its tree bookcases: Natural, Light Oak, Walnut, Dark Walnut, Warm Wood, Dark Warm Wood, Cool Dark Wood, Natural Finish and Custom. Not every design offers every finish, so check the options on the product page."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What sizes do tree bookshelves come in?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Listed sizes range from 15\"W x 8\"H x 8\"D up to 90\"W x 82\"H x 12\"D, with shelf depths from 7\" to 12\". Some listings give width first and others give height first. Several designs also offer a Custom size."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do tree bookcases come with installation?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Most Wrydeco tree bookcases offer a choice at checkout: assemble or install it yourself, or ask to be contacted to schedule on-site installation. Confirm the installation cost and whether your address is covered before ordering."
      }
    }
  ]
